"The card is active, and there was no control setup on your Stripe account."
msgstr ""
"ບັດພວມເປີດໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ ແລະ ບໍ່ມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າການຄວບຄຸມໃດໆ ໃນບັນຊີ Stripe ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/utils.py:0
msgid "The card is currently inactive, please activate it first."
msgstr "ປະຈຸບັນບັດຍັງບໍ່ເຄື່ອນໄຫວ, ກະລຸນາເປີດນຳໃຊ້ກ່ອນ."

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/models/hr_expense_stripe_card.py:0
msgid "The card must be ordered by a user."
msgstr "ບັດຕ້ອງຖືກສັ່ງຊື້ໂດຍຜູ້ໃຊ້ງານ."

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/models/hr_expense_stripe_card.py:0
msgid "The card must have a delivery date if it is marked as delivered."
msgstr "ບັດຕ້ອງມີວັນທີຈັດສົ່ງ ຖ້າຖືກໝາຍວ່າຈັດສົ່ງຮອດແລ້ວ."

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/utils.py:0
msgid "The card used was blocked."
msgstr "ບັດທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ຖືກລະງັບແລ້ວ."

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/wizard/hr_expense_stripe_card_block_wizard.py:0
msgid ""
"The card was blocked for the following reason:\n"
"%(reason)s"
msgstr ""
"ບັດຖືກລະງັບຍ້ອນເຫດຜົນດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:\n"
"%(reason)s"

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/utils.py:0
msgid "The card was declined because of the Stripe spending controls."
msgstr "ບັດຖືກປະຕິເສດຍ້ອນການຄວບຄຸມການໃຊ້ຈ່າຍຂອງ Stripe."

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/utils.py:0
msgid "The card's PIN is blocked."
msgstr "ລະຫັດ PIN ຂອງບັດຖືກລະງັບແລ້ວ."

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/models/hr_expense_stripe_dispute.py:0
msgid ""
"The cardholder claims they canceled their subscription/order, but the "
"merchant has no record of such cancellation, nor was one provided by the "
"cardholder.\n"
"Stripe has evaluated this evidence and determined that it is compelling.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຜູ້ຖືບັດອ້າງວ່າພວກເຂົາໄດ້ຍົກເລີກການສະໝັກສະມາຊິກ/ຄຳສັ່ງຊື້ແລ້ວ ແຕ່ຮ້ານຄ້າບໍ່ມີປະຫວັດການຍົກເລີກດັ່ງກ່າວ ແລະ "
"ຜູ້ຖືບັດກໍບໍ່ໄດ້ສົ່ງຫຼັກຖານໃຫ້.\n"
"Stripe ໄດ້ປະເມີນຫຼັກຖານນີ້ແລ້ວ ແລະ ເຫັນວ່າມີນ້ຳໜັກໜ້າເຊື່ອຖື.\n"

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#: model:mail.message.subtype,description:hr_expense_stripe.mt_stripe_cardholder_updated
msgid "The cardholder data was updated on Stripe"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນຜູ້ຖືບັດໄດ້ຮັບການອັບເດດໃນ Stripe ແລ້ວ"

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/utils.py:0
msgid "The cardholder is currently inactive."
msgstr "ປະຈຸບັນຜູ້ຖືບັດຢູ່ໃນສະຖານະບໍ່ເຄື່ອນໄຫວ."

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/utils.py:0
msgid "The cardholder is still under verification."
msgstr "ຜູ້ຖືບັດຍັງຢູ່ໃນລະຫວ່າງການກວດສອບຢັ້ງຢືນ."

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/utils.py:0
msgid "The cardholder was blocked."
msgstr "ຜູ້ຖືບັດຖືກລະງັບແລ້ວ."

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/models/hr_expense_stripe_dispute.py:0
msgid ""
"The cardholder/card provider didn't deactivate the card after claiming fraud "
"on previous transactions.\n"
"The dispute was automatically rejected by the card network.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຜູ້ຖືບັດ/ຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການບັດບໍ່ໄດ້ປິດການນຳໃຊ້ບັດ ຫຼັງຈາກແຈ້ງເຫດສໍ້ໂກງໃນທຸລະກຳກ່ອນໜ້າ.\n"
"ຂໍ້ຂັດແຍ່ງຈຶ່ງຖືກປະຕິເສດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຈາກເຄືອຂ່າຍບັດ.\n"

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/utils.py:0
msgid ""
"The charge is not allowed on the Stripe network, possibly because it is an "
"ATM withdrawal or cash advance."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຮຽກເກັບເງິນໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍ Stripe, ອາດຈະແມ່ນຍ້ອນເປັນການຖອນເງິນຈາກຕູ້ ATM ຫຼື ເປັນການເບີ"
"ກເງິນສົດລ່ວງໜ້າ."

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#: model:ir.model.constraint,message:hr_expense_stripe.constraint_product_mcc_stripe_tag_constraint_code_unique
msgid "The code of the MCC tag must be unique!"
msgstr "ລະຫັດຂອງແທັກ MCC ຕ້ອງບໍ່ຊ້ຳກັນ!"

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/models/hr_expense_stripe_card.py:0
msgid "The code to access your Odoo Expense Card is: %(code)s"
msgstr "ລະຫັດສຳລັບເຂົ້າເຖິງບັດລາຍຈ່າຍ Odoo ຂອງທ່ານແມ່ນ: %(code)s"

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/controllers/main.py:0
msgid "The content type provided is not valid for the purpose '%(purpose)s'."
msgstr "ປະເພດເນື້ອຫາທີ່ລະບຸບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງສຳລັບຈຸດປະສົງ '%(purpose)s'."

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/utils.py:0
msgid "The country of the phone number is not supported for SMS."
msgstr "ປະເທດຂອງເບີໂທລະສັບນີ້ຍັງບໍ່ຮອງຮັບການສົ່ງ SMS."

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/utils.py:0
msgid ""
"The creation rate limit for this type of cards has been reached. Please try "
"again later."
msgstr "ຮອດຂີດຈຳກັດການສ້າງບັດປະເພດນີ້ແລ້ວ. ກະລຸນາລອງໃໝ່ພາຍຫຼັງ."

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/models/hr_expense_stripe_card.py:0
msgid ""
"The delivery address must be in the European Union or in the United Kingdom."
msgstr "ທີ່ຢູ່ຈັດສົ່ງຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນສະຫະພາບເອີຣົບ ຫຼື ສະຫະລາຊະອານາຈັກ."

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/models/hr_expense_stripe_card.py:0
msgid "The delivery address must be in the European Union."
msgstr "ທີ່ຢູ່ຈັດສົ່ງຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນສະຫະພາບເອີຣົບ."

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/models/hr_expense_stripe_card.py:0
msgid "The delivery address must be set before activating the card."
msgstr "ຕ້ອງລະບຸທີ່ຢູ່ຈັດສົ່ງກ່ອນເປີດນຳໃຊ້ບັດ."

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/models/hr_expense_stripe_card.py:0
msgid ""
"The delivery address must have a street, city, zip code and country set."
msgstr "ທີ່ຢູ່ຈັດສົ່ງຕ້ອງລະບຸຖະໜົນ, ເມືອງ, ລະຫັດໄປສະນີ ແລະ ປະເທດໃຫ້ຄົບຖ້ວນ."

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/wizard/hr_expense_stripe_topup_wizard.py:0
msgid "The direct top-up isn't available outside of the US."
msgstr "ການເຕີມເງິນໂດຍກົງຍັງບໍ່ພ້ອມໃຫ້ບໍລິການນອກເຂດສະຫະລັດ."

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/models/hr_expense_stripe_dispute.py:0
msgid ""
"The dispute can only be submitted if the journal entries of all related "
"expenses are posted."
msgstr ""
"ສາມາດສົ່ງຂໍ້ຂັດແຍ່ງໄດ້ ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອລາຍການບັນທຶກປະຈຳວັນຂອງທຸກລາຍຈ່າຍທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການລົງບັນຊີແລ້ວ."

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/models/hr_expense_stripe_dispute.py:0
msgid "The dispute has been %(status)s."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຂັດແຍ່ງໄດ້ຮັບການ %(status)s ແລ້ວ."

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/models/hr_expense_stripe_dispute.py:0
msgid "The dispute has been updated."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຂັດແຍ່ງໄດ້ຮັບການອັບເດດແລ້ວ."

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/models/hr_expense_stripe_dispute.py:0
msgid ""
"The dispute is invalid because there is already a refund for the transaction "
"in which the refund and dispute amounts sum up to more than the original "
"transaction amount.\n"
"The dispute was automatically rejected due to this discrepancy.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ຂັດແຍ່ງບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ເນື່ອງຈາກມີການສົ່ງເງິນຄືນສຳລັບທຸລະກຳນີ້ແລ້ວ ເຊິ່ງເມື່ອລວມຍອດສົ່ງເງິນຄືນ ແລະ ຍອດຂໍ້ຂັດແຍ່"
"ງເຂົ້າກັນຈະຫຼາຍກວ່າຍອດເດີມຂອງທຸລະກຳ.\n"
"ຂໍ້ຂັດແຍ່ງຈຶ່ງຖືກປະຕິເສດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຍ້ອນຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງຂອງຍອດເງິນນີ້.\n"

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/models/hr_expense_stripe_dispute.py:0
msgid ""
"The dispute was submitted past the disputable deadline.\n"
"The dispute was automatically rejected by the card network.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ຂັດແຍ່ງຖືກສົ່ງເກີນກຳນົດເວລາທີ່ສາມາດຍື່ນຂໍ້ຂັດແຍ່ງໄດ້.\n"
"ຂໍ້ຂັດແຍ່ງຈຶ່ງຖືກປະຕິເສດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຈາກເຄືອຂ່າຍບັດ.\n"

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/models/hr_expense_stripe_dispute.py:0
msgid ""
"The dispute, created under Condition 11.3: No Authorization, is invalid due "
"to the transaction being authorized as indicated in the Mastercard Core "
"Rules and Mastercard Product and Service Rules.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ຂັດແຍ່ງທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນພາຍໃຕ້ເງື່ອນໄຂ 11.3: ບໍ່ມີການອະນຸມັດ ແມ່ນບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ເນື່ອງຈາກທຸລະກຳໄດ້ຮັບການອະນຸມັດຕາ"
"ມທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນກົດລະບຽບຫຼັກຂອງ Mastercard ແລະ ກົດລະບຽບຜະລິດຕະພັນ ແລະ ການບໍລິການຂອງ "
"Mastercard.\n"

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/models/hr_expense.py:0
msgid "The disputed amount cannot be greater than the expense amount."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນເງິນທີ່ຂັດແຍ່ງບໍ່ສາມາດຫຼາຍກວ່າຈຳນວນເງິນລາຍຈ່າຍໄດ້."

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/models/hr_expense.py:0
msgid "The disputed amount cannot be negative."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນເງິນທີ່ຂັດແຍ່ງບໍ່ສາມາດຕິດລົບໄດ້."

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/models/hr_expense_stripe_card.py:0
msgid "The employee must have a user to be able to access safely their card."
msgstr ""
"ພະນັກງານຕ້ອງມີບັນຊີຜູ້ໃຊ້ງານ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງບັດຂອງຕົນເອງໄດ້ຢ່າງປອດໄພ."

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/controllers/main.py:0
msgid ""
"The file name provided is not valid. Only use alpha-numeric characters or '.-"
"_'."
msgstr ""
"ຊື່ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ລະບຸບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະຕົວອັກສອນ, ຕົວເລກ ຫຼື ເຄື່ອງໝາຍ '.-_' ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/controllers/main.py:0
msgid "The file provided is too large. Maximum size is %(size)s MiB."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ລະບຸມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ເກີນໄປ. ຂະໜາດສູງສຸດແມ່ນ %(size)s MiB."

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:hr_expense_stripe.field_hr_expense_stripe_card_receive_wizard__last_4_challenge
msgid ""
"The last 4 digits of the card you received. This is used to confirm that you "
"have received the correct card."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເລກ 4 ໂຕທ້າຍຂອງບັດທີ່ທ່ານໄດ້ຮັບ. ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຢັ້ງຢືນວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ຮັບບັດທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/wizard/hr_expense_stripe_card_receive_wizard.py:0
msgid ""
"The last 4 digits you entered do not match the card you received. Please "
"check and try again."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເລກ 4 ໂຕທ້າຍທີ່ທ່ານປ້ອນບໍ່ກົງກັບບັດທີ່ທ່ານໄດ້ຮັບ. ກະລຸນາກວດສອບ ແລະ ລອງໃໝ່ອີກຄັ້ງ."

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/models/hr_expense_stripe_dispute.py:0
msgid ""
"The liability shifts to the issuer for fraudulent disputes if the card-"
"present transaction was authorized with a chip-reading terminal.\n"
"This dispute was automatically rejected by the card network.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມຮັບຜິດຊອບຈະຕົກເປັນຂອງຜູ້ນຳອອກບັດ ສຳລັບຂໍ້ຂັດແຍ່ງການສໍ້ໂກງ ຖ້າທຸລະກຳທີ່ສະແດງບັດໄດ້ຮັບການອະນຸມັດຜ່າ"
"ນເຄື່ອງອ່ານຊິບ.\n"
"ຂໍ້ຂັດແຍ່ງນີ້ຈຶ່ງຖືກປະຕິເສດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຈາກເຄືອຂ່າຍບັດ.\n"

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/models/hr_expense_stripe_dispute.py:0
msgid ""
"The merchant has provided evidence that indicates this transaction was "
"authorized by the cardholder.\n"
"Stripe has evaluated this evidence and determined that it is compelling.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຮ້ານຄ້າໄດ້ສະໜອງຫຼັກຖານທີ່ສະແດງວ່າ ທຸລະກຳນີ້ໄດ້ຮັບການອະນຸມັດໂດຍຜູ້ຖືບັດ.\n"
"Stripe ໄດ້ປະເມີນຫຼັກຖານນີ້ແລ້ວ ແລະ ເຫັນວ່າມີນ້ຳໜັກໜ້າເຊື່ອຖື.\n"

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/models/hr_expense_stripe_dispute.py:0
msgid ""
"The merchant provided evidence indicating that the merchandise was shipped/"
"delivered.\n"
"Stripe has evaluated this evidence and determined that it is compelling.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຮ້ານຄ້າໄດ້ສະໜອງຫຼັກຖານທີ່ສະແດງວ່າ ສິນຄ້າໄດ້ຮັບການຈັດສົ່ງແລ້ວ.\n"
"Stripe ໄດ້ປະເມີນຫຼັກຖານນີ້ແລ້ວ ແລະ ເຫັນວ່າມີນ້ຳໜັກໜ້າເຊື່ອຖື.\n"

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/models/hr_expense_stripe_dispute.py:0
msgid ""
"The merchant provided information indicating the item/service provided "
"matched the description.\n"
"Stripe has evaluated this evidence and determined that it is compelling.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຮ້ານຄ້າໄດ້ສະໜອງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສະແດງວ່າ ສິນຄ້າ/ການບໍລິການທີ່ສະໜອງໃຫ້ນັ້ນກົງກັບລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ລະບຸ.\n"
"Stripe ໄດ້ປະເມີນຫຼັກຖານນີ້ແລ້ວ ແລະ ເຫັນວ່າມີນ້ຳໜັກໜ້າເຊື່ອຖື.\n"

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:hr_expense_stripe.field_hr_expense_stripe_card__card_name
msgid "The name displayed on the card"
msgstr "ຊື່ທີ່ສະແດງເທິງບັດ"

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/models/hr_expense_stripe_card.py:0
msgid ""
"The phone number associated with your Odoo Expense card(s) has been updated. "
"If it was not requested by you, please contact your administrator."
msgstr ""
"ເບີໂທລະສັບທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບບັດລາຍຈ່າຍ Odoo ຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ຮັບການອັບເດດແລ້ວ. ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ເປັນຜູ້ຮ້ອງຂໍ, ກະລຸນ"
"າຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ເບິ່ງແຍງລະບົບຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/wizard/hr_expense_stripe_cardholder_wizard.py:0
msgid "The phone number is invalid."
msgstr "ເບີໂທລະສັບບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/controllers/main.py:0
msgid "The purpose '%(purpose)s' is not allowed to be used with this model."
msgstr "ບໍ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ນຳໃຊ້ຈຸດປະສົງ '%(purpose)s' ກັບໂມເດວນີ້."

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/controllers/main.py:0
msgid "The purpose provided is not valid."
msgstr "ຈຸດປະສົງທີ່ລະບຸບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/controllers/main.py:0
msgid "The record doesn't exist."
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນບັນທຶກນີ້."

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/utils.py:0
msgid ""
"The route '%(route)s' is not allowed to be called from the Stripe IAP proxy "
"server."
msgstr "ບໍ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເອີ້ນເສັ້ນທາງ '%(route)s' ຈາກເຊີບເວີພຣັອກຊີ Stripe IAP."

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/utils.py:0
msgid ""
"The sms service is currently experiencing a lot of request. Please try again "
"in a few minutes."
msgstr ""
"ຂະນະນີ້ບໍລິການ SMS ມີຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍເຂົ້າມາເປັນຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ. ກະລຸນາລອງໃໝ່ອີກຄັ້ງໃນອີກສອງສາມນາທີ."

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/models/hr_expense_stripe_dispute.py:0
msgid "The specified field doesn't support attachments."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ລະບຸບໍ່ຮອງຮັບໄຟລ໌ຄັດຕິດ."

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hr_expense_stripe.view_hr_expense_stripe_card_form
msgid ""
"The spending limits set on this card are higher than the limits set by "
"Stripe of 50.000 per day and per transaction."
msgstr ""
"ວົງເງິນຈຳກັດການໃຊ້ຈ່າຍທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນບັດນີ້ສູງກວ່າຂີດຈຳກັດຂອງ Stripe ເຊິ່ງກຳນົດໄວ້ທີ່ 50,000 ຕໍ່ມື້ ແລະ ຕໍ່"
"ທຸລະກຳ."

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/wizard/hr_expense_stripe_topup_wizard.py:0
msgid "The statement description can only contain 15 ASCII characters"
msgstr "ລາຍລະອຽດໃນໃບແຈ້ງຍອດສາມາດມີຕົວອັກສອນ ASCII ໄດ້ສູງສຸດພຽງ 15 ຕົວອັກສອນ"

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#: model:product.mcc.stripe.tag,name:hr_expense_stripe.theatrical_ticket_agencies
msgid "Theatrical Ticket Agencies"
