#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/utils.py:0
msgid ""
"There is insufficient funds on your Stripe account, please top-up your "
"account first."
msgstr ""
"ເງິນໃນບັນຊີ Stripe ຂອງທ່ານບໍ່ພຽງພໍ, ກະລຸນາເຕີມເງິນເຂົ້າບັນຊີຂອງທ່ານກ່ອນ."

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/utils.py:0
msgid ""
"There was an error in your Odoo database and Stripe received an invalid "
"response."
msgstr ""
"ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ Odoo ຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ Stripe ໄດ້ຮັບການຕອບກັບທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/utils.py:0
msgid ""
"There was an error when sending the SMS, please try again later. If the "
"problem persists, please contact the support."
msgstr ""
"ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຂະນະສົ່ງ SMS, ກະລຸນາລອງໃໝ່ພາຍຫຼັງ. ຖ້າບັນຫາຍັງຄົງຢູ່, ກະລຸນາຕິດຕໍ່ຝ່າຍຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ."

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/utils.py:0
msgid ""
"There was an error when sending the email, please try again later. If the "
"problem persists, please contact the support."
msgstr ""
"ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຂະນະສົ່ງອີເມວ, ກະລຸນາລອງໃໝ່ພາຍຫຼັງ. ຖ້າບັນຫາຍັງຄົງຢູ່, ກະລຸນາຕິດຕໍ່ຝ່າຍຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ."

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/utils.py:0
msgid "There was an unexpected error on Odoo IAP proxy server"
msgstr "ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດທີ່ບໍ່ຄາດຄິດໃນເຊີບເວີພຣັອກຊີ Odoo IAP"

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/models/hr_expense_stripe_dispute.py:0
msgid ""
"This dispute has not met the minimum amount threshold set by the card "
"network based on the MCC.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ຂັດແຍ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ເຖິງເກນຈຳນວນເງິນຂັ້ນຕ່ຳທີ່ເຄືອຂ່າຍບັດກຳນົດໄວ້ຕາມລະຫັດ MCC.\n"

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/models/hr_expense_stripe_dispute.py:0
msgid ""
"This dispute is invalid as more than 35 total disputes have been submitted "
"within 120 calendar days of this dispute.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ຂັດແຍ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ເນື່ອງຈາກມີການຍື່ນຂໍ້ຂັດແຍ່ງລວມຫຼາຍກວ່າ 35 ລາຍການພາຍໃນ 120 ວັນຕາມປະຕິທິນຂອງຂໍ້ຂັ"
"ດແຍ່ງນີ້.\n"

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/models/hr_expense_stripe_dispute.py:0
msgid ""
"This dispute is invalid as the transaction was unattended, chip-initiated, "
"and online authorized (e.g., swiping a chip card at an unattended gas pump, "
"parking meter, or ATM).\n"
"The liability is on the card provider for these types of transactions.\n"
"The dispute was automatically rejected by the card network.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ຂັດແຍ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ເນື່ອງຈາກເປັນທຸລະກຳແບບບໍ່ມີພະນັກງານດູແລ, ຮອງຮັບດ້ວຍຊິບ ແລະ ໄດ້ຮັບການອະນຸມັດທາງອ"
"ອນລາຍ (ເຊັ່ນ: ການສຽບບັດຊິບຢູ່ຕູ້ຈ່າຍນ້ຳມັນອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ຕູ້ເກັບເງິນບ່ອນຈອດລົດ ຫຼື ຕູ້ ATM).\n"
"ຄວາມຮັບຜິດຊອບຈະເປັນຂອງຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການບັດສຳລັບທຸລະກຳປະເພດນີ້.\n"
"ຂໍ້ຂັດແຍ່ງຈຶ່ງຖືກປະຕິເສດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຈາກເຄືອຂ່າຍບັດ.\n"

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/models/hr_expense_stripe_dispute.py:0
msgid ""
"This dispute is invalid because the merchant attempted 3DS for a Card-Not-"
"Present (CNP) transaction, but the card provider did not have 3DS enabled "
"for the card.\n"
"The dispute was automatically rejected by the card network.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ຂັດແຍ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ເນື່ອງຈາກຮ້ານຄ້າໄດ້ພະຍາຍາມນຳໃຊ້ 3DS ສຳລັບທຸລະກຳແບບບໍ່ສະແດງບັດ (CNP) ແຕ່ຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍ"
"ລິການບັດບໍ່ໄດ້ເປີດໃຊ້ 3DS ສຳລັບບັດດັ່ງກ່າວ.\n"
"ຂໍ້ຂັດແຍ່ງຈຶ່ງຖືກປະຕິເສດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຈາກເຄືອຂ່າຍບັດ.\n"

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/models/hr_expense_stripe_dispute.py:0
msgid ""
"This dispute is invalid since the transaction qualifies for Mastercard Easy "
"Payment Service (MEPS) Transaction, which allows businesses to accept "
"Mastercard without customers pausing to sign or enter a PIN.\n"
"With MEPS, the liability shifts onto the card provider.\n"
"The dispute was automatically rejected by Mastercard.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ຂັດແຍ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ເນື່ອງຈາກທຸລະກຳເຂົ້າເກນທຸລະກຳ Mastercard Easy Payment Service (MEPS) "
"ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທຸລະກິດຮັບບັດ Mastercard ໄດ້ໂດຍທີ່ລູກຄ້າບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເຊັນຊື່ ຫຼື ປ້ອນລະຫັດ PIN.\n"
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ MEPS ຄວາມຮັບຜິດຊອບຈະຕົກເປັນຂອງຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການບັດ.\n"
"ຂໍ້ຂັດແຍ່ງຈຶ່ງຖືກປະຕິເສດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຈາກ Mastercard.\n"

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/models/hr_expense_stripe_dispute.py:0
msgid ""
"This dispute, created for Card-Not-Present fraud, is invalid because the "
"card network has indicated the cardholder was securely authenticated.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ຂັດແຍ່ງນີ້ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນຍ້ອນການສໍ້ໂກງແບບບໍ່ສະແດງບັດ ແມ່ນບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ເນື່ອງຈາກເຄືອຂ່າຍບັດໄດ້ລະບຸວ່າຜູ້ຖືບັດໄດ້ຮັບກາ"
