msgstr "ຂໍ້ຂັດແຍ່ງຂອງທ່ານສຳລັບທຸລະກຳ {{ object.name }} ໄດ້ຖືກຕັດສິນເສຍແລ້ວ"

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#: model:mail.template,subject:hr_expense_stripe.email_template_hr_expense_stripe_dispute_submitted
msgid "Your Dispute for the transaction {{ object.name }} Has Been Submitted"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຂັດແຍ່ງຂອງທ່ານສຳລັບທຸລະກຳ {{ object.name }} ໄດ້ຖືກສົ່ງຮຽບຮ້ອຍແລ້ວ"

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#: model:mail.template,subject:hr_expense_stripe.email_template_hr_expense_stripe_dispute_won
msgid "Your Dispute for the transaction {{ object.name }} Has Been Won"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຂັດແຍ່ງຂອງທ່ານສຳລັບທຸລະກຳ {{ object.name }} ໄດ້ຖືກຕັດສິນຊະນະແລ້ວ"

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#: model:mail.template,subject:hr_expense_stripe.email_template_hr_expense_stripe_card_canceled
msgid "Your Expense Card Has Been Canceled"
msgstr "ບັດລາຍຈ່າຍຂອງທ່ານຖືກຍົກເລີກແລ້ວ"

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#: model:mail.template,subject:hr_expense_stripe.email_template_hr_expense_stripe_card_shipped
