msgstr "ບັດລາຍຈ່າຍຂອງທ່ານຖືກຈັດສົ່ງແລ້ວ"

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#: model:mail.template,subject:hr_expense_stripe.email_template_hr_expense_stripe_card_assigned
msgid "Your Expense Card has been Assigned"
msgstr "ມອບໝາຍບັດລາຍຈ່າຍຂອງທ່ານແລ້ວ"

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#: model:mail.template,subject:hr_expense_stripe.email_template_hr_expense_stripe_card_ordered
msgid "Your Expense Card has been Ordered"
msgstr "ສັ່ງຊື້ບັດລາຍຈ່າຍຂອງທ່ານແລ້ວ"

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/utils.py:0
msgid ""
"Your Odoo database failed to respond to Stripe in time, and the "
"authorization was refused by default."
msgstr ""
"ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ Odoo ຂອງທ່ານຕອບສະໜອງກັບ Stripe ບໍ່ທັນເວລາ, ແລະ ການອະນຸມັດຈຶ່ງຖືກປະຕິເສດໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້"
"ນ."

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/utils.py:0
msgid "Your Stripe account is disabled."
msgstr "ບັນຊີ Stripe ຂອງທ່ານຖືກປິດການໃຊ້ງານ."

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/utils.py:0
msgid ""
"Your account balance isn't zero, please use any remaining funds or contact "
"support to close your account."
msgstr ""
"ຍອດເຫຼືອໃນບັນຊີຂອງທ່ານບໍ່ແມ່ນສູນ, ກະລຸນານຳໃຊ້ເງິນທີ່ຍັງເຫຼືອໃຫ້ໝົດ ຫຼື ຕິດຕໍ່ຝ່າຍຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອເພື່ອປິດບັນຊີຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/utils.py:0
msgid ""
"Your dispute creation rate limit has been reached. Please try again later."
msgstr "ຮອດຂີດຈຳກັດການສ້າງຂໍ້ຂັດແຍ່ງຂອງທ່ານແລ້ວ. ກະລຸນາລອງໃໝ່ພາຍຫຼັງ."

